{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Image Forensics Countermeasure.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Image Forensics Countermeasure.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"image forensics countermeasure image forensics countermeasure","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Image Forensics Countermeasure.md","fileName":"Image Forensics Countermeasure.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Image Forensics Countermeasure","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-16 00:47\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Image Authenticity and Forensic Reasoning]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Image Authenticity and Forensic Reasoning","fakephotos.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Image Forensics Countermeasure.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Image Forensics Countermeasure.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"image forensics countermeasure image forensics countermeasure","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Image Forensics Countermeasure.md","fileName":"Image Forensics Countermeasure.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Image Forensics Countermeasure","heading":"Image Forensics Countermeasure","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"An image forensics countermeasure is a manipulation intended to erase, imitate, or avoid a detector's expected trace. A skilled forger can alter metadata, reinsert noise, equalize compression, or adapt generated imagery after learning how a forensic method works.\n\nThis creates a continuing contest between authentication and fabrication. New methods expose regularities that current tools overlook, while new forgeries are designed around published tests. The possibility of countermeasures is why a clean result should not be treated as conclusive proof of authenticity.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Image Authenticity and Forensic Reasoning","fakephotos.epub"],"properti